<h2 id="readers-reviews"   class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center" >Reader&#8217;s Reviews</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">&#8220;<em>Wow this recipe is so so delicious, thank you for sharing! I added red pepper flakes to my ragu for spice and I used homemade veggie stock as liquid for my polenta. If you can, use fresh herbs, I can taste each of them and they add so much depth to the flavors. So happy with how this meal turned out! 10/10 would recommend and will be making again!&#8221; &#8212; Suz<br></em></p>



