<h2 id="pulled-pork-ragu-with-polenta"   class="wprm-recipe-name wprm-block-text-bold">Pulled Pork Ragu with Polenta</h2>
<div class="wprm-spacer"></div>
<span class="wprm-recipe-details wprm-recipe-author wprm-block-text-light">Laura Bashar | Family Spice</span>
<div class="wprm-spacer"></div>
<div class="wprm-recipe-summary wprm-block-text-normal"><span style="display: block;">Use up leftovers to make this incredible pulled pork ragu. Serve over pasta or my favorite, creamy polenta and you&#x27;ve got an incredible Italian comfort food that will blow you away! </span></div>
<div class="wprm-spacer"></div>
