    3 years ago
</div>
    
    <div class="wpd-comment-share wpd-hidden wpd-tooltip wpd-top">
    <i class='fas fa-share-alt' aria-hidden='true'></i>
    <div class="wpd-tooltip-content">
        <a class='wc_tw' rel='noreferrer' target='_blank' href='https://x.com/intent/post?text=I&#8217;m grateful for a recipe that doesn&#8217;t start with a whole p... &url=https%3A%2F%2Ffamilyspice.com%2Fleftover-pulled-pork-ragu%2F%23comment-94940' title='Share On X'><i class='wpf-cta' aria-hidden='true'><svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 512 512'><path d='M389.2 48h70.6L305.6 224.2 487 464H345L233.7 318.6 106.5 464H35.8L200.7 275.5 26.8 48H172.4L272.9 180.9 389.2 48zM364.4 421.8h39.1L151.1 88h-42L364.4 421.8z'/></svg></i></a>
