    <div class="wpd-comment-text">
    <p><img class="wprm-comment-rating" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAP///wAAACwAAAAAAQABAEACAkQBADs=" data-lazy-src="https://familyspice.com/wp-content/plugins/wp-recipe-maker/assets/icons/rating/stars-alt-5.svg" alt="5 stars" width="80" height="16" /><br />
Wow this recipe is so so delicious, thank you for sharing! I added red pepper flakes to my ragu for spice and I used homemade veggie stock as liquid for my polenta. If you can, use fresh herbs, I can taste each of them and they add so much depth to the flavors. So happy with how this meal turned out! 10/10 would recommend and will be making again!</p>

</div>
